OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear to
OL,6,Fstart the evening but clouding over
OL,7,Fwith outbreaks of rain and drizzle
OL,8,Fovernight. Turning misty with some
OL,9,Ffog, mainly covering higher ground.
OL,10,FThe wind remains light throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FRain, drizzle and any fog will
OL,13,Fclear during the morning, with bright
OL,14,For sunny spells developing during the
OL,15,Fafternoon. Cloudier in east. Feeling
OL,16,Fcooler compared with Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
