OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fmornings, with a risk of showers in
OL,7,Fthe coming days. Sunny spells develop
OL,8,Fduring the afternoons. Generally light
OL,9,Fwinds. Temperatures near average for
OL,10,Fthe time of year.
